</section><section id="dag-layout"><h3><bdi class="secno">5.5 </bdi>DAG layout</h3><a href="#dag-layout" class="self-link" aria-label="Section 5.5"></a>
<p>Both profiles use the <code>balanced</code> layout where distance from root to each leaf is the same number of hops.</p>
<pre><code>balanced:                              trickle:

         root                                root
        /    \                         /   /  |  \   \
     node     node                  leaf node leaf node ...
